   "lines": [
    "# Weyro",
    "",
    "",
    "### Automotive repair marketplace for India connecting vehicle owners with workshops, garages and spare-parts distributors.",
    "",
    "Weyro lets vehicle owners post damage/repair requests with photos, receive",
    "quotations from nearby workshops, book and pay in INR through Razorpay, and",
    "chat in real time. The Expo SDK 58 / React Native app talks to a NestJS 11",
    "modular monolith on PostgreSQL 16 + PostGIS, with domain state machines for",
    "requests, quotes, bookings and payments, S3 presigned uploads with EXIF",
    "stripping, Socket.IO chat, Expo push notifications, JWT refresh rotation,",
    "role-based guards, Redis rate limiting, and deployment on Railway and EAS.",
    "",
    "Built with TypeScript · React Native · Expo · NestJS · PostgreSQL · Prisma · Redis · Socket.io · Razorpay · Railway",
    "",
    "[Visit](https://github.com/revanthrao92-debug/weyro)"
   ]
  }
